<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Migration on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/en/tags/migration/</link><description>Recent content in Migration on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><managingEditor>蓝宝石的傻话</managingEditor><lastBuildDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 09:30:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/en/tags/migration/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>incus move: What One Command Actually Does</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/en/posts/incus/incus-move-migration/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 09:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/en/posts/incus/incus-move-migration/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This is the heart of the series: &amp;ldquo;migrate by command&amp;rdquo; boils down to one line — &lt;code&gt;incus move &amp;lt;instance&amp;gt; --target &amp;lt;member&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;. But the command&amp;rsquo;s semantics, boundaries, and common misunderstandings deserve their own post.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="one-command-four-automated-steps"&gt;One command, four automated steps&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="code-block-wrapper" data-lang="bash"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="code-block-header"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="code-block-meta"&gt;&lt;span class="code-language"&gt;bash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;button class="copy-button" aria-label="Copy code"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="copy-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"&gt;&lt;rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"/&gt;&lt;path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="check-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"&gt;&lt;polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="code-block-body"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;incus move web01 --target incus-n2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 960 540" font-family="-apple-system,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif" style="width:100%;max-width:960px;margin:1.5em auto;display:block;" role="img" aria-label="incus move four-step flow and stop-vs-live migration notes"&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="0" y="0" width="960" height="540" fill="#fafbfd"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="32" y="42" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;incus move 一条命令背后：自动完成的四步&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="32" y="64" font-size="12.5" fill="#7a86a8"&gt;你只发指令，停机 → 拷盘 → 起来 → 清理由 incusd 编排完成，不用手动 stop/copy/start&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;rect x="32" y="88" width="896" height="48" rx="10" fill="#1a1f36"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="56" y="118" font-size="14.5" fill="#7ef0c0" font-family="Consolas,monospace"&gt;incus move web01 --target incus-n2&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="880" y="118" font-size="11.5" fill="#aab3d0" text-anchor="end"&gt;集群内 · 服务端迁移&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;rect x="32" y="164" width="196" height="96" rx="12" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#635bff" stroke-width="1.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="130" y="194" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" fill="#635bff"&gt;① 停机&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="130" y="218" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#4a5478"&gt;容器自动 stop&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="130" y="236" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7a86a8"&gt;（也可以先手动停）&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;line x1="228" y1="212" x2="256" y2="212" stroke="#7a86a8" stroke-width="1.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;polygon points="256,206 256,218 266,212" fill="#7a86a8"/&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="266" y="164" width="196" height="96" rx="12" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#635bff" stroke-width="1.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="364" y="194" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" fill="#635bff"&gt;② 传输根盘&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="364" y="218" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#4a5478"&gt;zfs send | zfs receive&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="364" y="236" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7a86a8"&gt;比纯文件拷贝快很多&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;line x1="462" y1="212" x2="490" y2="212" stroke="#7a86a8" stroke-width="1.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;polygon points="490,206 490,218 500,212" fill="#7a86a8"/&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="500" y="164" width="196" height="96" rx="12" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#635bff" stroke-width="1.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="598" y="194" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" fill="#635bff"&gt;③ 目标启动&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="598" y="218" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#4a5478"&gt;在 incus-n2 上 start&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="598" y="236" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7a86a8"&gt;IP / 状态自动恢复&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;line x1="696" y1="212" x2="724" y2="212" stroke="#7a86a8" stroke-width="1.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;polygon points="724,206 724,218 734,212" fill="#7a86a8"/&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="734" y="164" width="194" height="96" rx="12" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e0483d" stroke-width="1.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="831" y="194" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e0483d"&gt;④ 源端清理&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="831" y="218" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#4a5478"&gt;move = 搬走，原节点上&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="831" y="236" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#4a5478"&gt;实例不存在了&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;rect x="32" y="292" width="432" height="96" rx="12" fill="#f6fbf9" stroke="#0f9d6e" stroke-width="1.2"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="52" y="320" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#0f9d6e"&gt;本地存储 = 停机迁移（本系列路线）&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="52" y="344" font-size="12" fill="#4a5478"&gt;容器约 5~30 秒（取决于磁盘大小），VM 要拷 qcow2&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="52" y="364" font-size="12" fill="#4a5478"&gt;且重启，可能 1 到数分钟 —— 避开业务高峰&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="496" y="292" width="432" height="96" rx="12" fill="#fdf6ec" stroke="#e8890c" stroke-width="1.2"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="516" y="320" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#e8890c"&gt;共享存储（Ceph 等）= live 迁移&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="516" y="344" font-size="12" fill="#4a5478"&gt;数据不用搬、只搬运行时状态，几乎零中断；&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="516" y="364" font-size="12" fill="#4a5478"&gt;代价是 Ceph 全家桶 —— 2×16G 场景通常不值得&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="32" y="404" width="432" height="96" rx="12" fill="#f1f3fa" stroke="#d7ddec" stroke-width="1.2"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="52" y="432" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;实用开关&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="52" y="456" font-size="12" fill="#4a5478"&gt;--refresh 增量传输，缩短二次迁移窗口；&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="52" y="476" font-size="12" fill="#4a5478"&gt;--stateless 不搬内存态；incus copy 复制留底不删源&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="496" y="404" width="432" height="96" rx="12" fill="#f1f3fa" stroke="#d7ddec" stroke-width="1.2"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="516" y="432" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;批量维护&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="516" y="456" font-size="12" fill="#4a5478"&gt;incus cluster evacuate incus-n1 一键清空一台；&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="516" y="476" font-size="12" fill="#4a5478"&gt;incus cluster restore incus-n1 维护完迁回&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;incusd orchestrates four steps after the command: stop, transfer the root disk via &lt;code&gt;zfs send | zfs receive&lt;/code&gt;, start on the target node, clean up the source — no manual stop/copy/start needed. The two cards bottom-left mark the key boundary: local storage always means downtime migration (about 5–30 seconds for containers, 1 to several minutes for VMs); shared storage (Ceph) is what enables live migration. Bottom-right: the practical flags and the batch-maintenance entry points.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>One UI for Multiple Clusters: What Open Source Offers</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/en/posts/incus/incus-multicluster-cross-cluster-migration/</link><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 09:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/en/posts/incus/incus-multicluster-cross-cluster-migration/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;The requirement grew: two independent clusters, one per subnet (each starting with a single leader, replicas to follow), one web frontend above both, plus one-click cross-cluster migration. This post separates &amp;ldquo;intra-cluster migration&amp;rdquo; from &amp;ldquo;cross-cluster migration&amp;rdquo; — they are not the same thing at all — and covers the five hard constraints of going cross-cluster, plus what the open-source survey concluded.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="pinning-the-topology-down"&gt;Pinning the topology down&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 960 560" font-family="-apple-system,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif" style="width:100%;max-width:960px;margin:1.5em auto;display:block;" role="img" aria-label="one frontend over two independent clusters in two subnets"&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="0" y="0" width="960" height="560" fill="#fafbfd"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="32" y="42" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;目标拓扑：一个前端，两个网段，两个独立主集群&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="32" y="64" font-size="12.5" fill="#7a86a8"&gt;L1 控制面 → L2 集群 → L3 成员 → L4 实例 · 两个集群之间没有任何共享数据库&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;rect x="280" y="88" width="400" height="52" rx="12" fill="#635bff"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="480" y="120" font-size="14.5" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffffff"&gt;Web 前端（incus-hub / 控制平面）&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;line x1="380" y1="140" x2="240" y2="188" stroke="#7a86a8" stroke-width="1.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;line x1="580" y1="140" x2="720" y2="188" stroke="#7a86a8" stroke-width="1.5"/&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;rect x="64" y="188" width="380" height="220" rx="14" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#635bff" stroke-width="1.8"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="88" y="218" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#635bff"&gt;集群 A · 网段 1&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="88" y="238" font-size="11.5" fill="#7a86a8" font-family="Consolas,monospace"&gt;192.168.10.0/24&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="88" y="252" width="150" height="58" rx="10" fill="#f7f7ff" stroke="#635bff" stroke-width="1.2"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="163" y="276" font-size="12.5" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;A1 主&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="163" y="296" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" fill="#635bff"&gt;voter · 持库&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="254" y="252" width="150" height="58" rx="10" fill="#f0faf5" stroke="#0f9d6e" stroke-width="1.2"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="329" y="276" font-size="12.5" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;A2 副&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="329" y="296" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" fill="#0f9d6e"&gt;standby · 不投票&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="88" y="322" width="316" height="34" rx="8" fill="#f1f3fa"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="246" y="344" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#4a5478"&gt;实例：web01 · db01 · vm01 …（location 标注所在成员）&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="88" y="388" font-size="11" fill="#7a86a8"&gt;dqlite / Raft · 只管自己集群内部&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;rect x="516" y="188" width="380" height="220" rx="14" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#00b8d9" stroke-width="1.8"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="540" y="218" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#00b8d9"&gt;集群 B · 网段 2&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="540" y="238" font-size="11.5" fill="#7a86a8" font-family="Consolas,monospace"&gt;192.168.20.0/24&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="540" y="252" width="150" height="58" rx="10" fill="#f0fbfd" stroke="#00b8d9" stroke-width="1.2"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="615" y="276" font-size="12.5" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;B1 主&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="615" y="296" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" fill="#00b8d9"&gt;voter · 持库&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="706" y="252" width="150" height="58" rx="10" fill="#f0faf5" stroke="#0f9d6e" stroke-width="1.2"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="781" y="276" font-size="12.5" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;B2 副&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="781" y="296" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" fill="#0f9d6e"&gt;standby · 不投票&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="540" y="322" width="316" height="34" rx="8" fill="#f1f3fa"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="698" y="344" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#4a5478"&gt;实例：cache01 · ci01 …&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="540" y="388" font-size="11" fill="#7a86a8"&gt;dqlite / Raft · 只管自己集群内部&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;line x1="444" y1="300" x2="516" y2="300" stroke="#e8890c" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7,5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="480" y="288" font-size="11.5" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e8890c"&gt;跨集群迁移&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="480" y="326" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7a86a8"&gt;copy + delete&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;rect x="64" y="432" width="380" height="96" rx="12" fill="#f1f3fa"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="84" y="458" font-size="12.5" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;两个集群之间：零共享&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="84" y="480" font-size="11.5" fill="#4a5478"&gt;profile / 网络 / 存储池定义互不相通，&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="84" y="499" font-size="11.5" fill="#4a5478"&gt;OVN 逻辑交换机也不互通 —— 迁移要显式适配&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="516" y="432" width="380" height="96" rx="12" fill="#f6fbf9"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="536" y="458" font-size="12.5" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;每个集群内部：1 主 + N 副&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="536" y="480" font-size="11.5" fill="#4a5478"&gt;副死无感；主死只影响该集群，另一个集群照常 ——&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="536" y="499" font-size="11.5" fill="#4a5478"&gt;故障域天然隔离在集群这一层&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Three layers: a single web frontend at the top (incus-hub / the control plane); below it two clusters sharing nothing — cluster A on subnet 1 (192.168.10.0/24, leader A1 + replica A2) and cluster B on subnet 2 (192.168.20.0/24, leader B1 + replica B2), each internally shaped like the &amp;ldquo;1 leader + N replicas&amp;rdquo; from earlier posts. The orange dashed line is cross-cluster migration: copy + delete in essence, with an IP change guaranteed. There is no shared database between the clusters; profiles, networks, and pool definitions are disconnected — that fact creates every difficulty below.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>